+* **Axe, cooldown ledger and player knockback (2026-11-05, UNVERIFIED: not compiled, not run)**: see design.md "Weapon payments and the cooldown ledger". Code: `combat/rules.rs` (`AXE_BLOW`), `combat/profile.rs` (axe charge 0.75 / 40, weight 1.0), `Mobs::stagger`, `App::{switch_weapon, swing_debt, knock_player}` in `lib.rs`. Known gaps: a tap during the axe's cooldown now counts as a short charge (it pays the stamina of a charged blow, ratio floor 0.25); the ledger does not survive a save or a respawn reset beyond `enter_world`; a swap to the bare hand does not record its own debt (4 ticks); knockback ignores armour and has no per-mob strength.
diff --git a/roadmap/design.md b/roadmap/design.md
